title: The Jena Congress
subtitle: The party meets to settle the year's accounts.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month >= 8 and month <= 9 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and e21_jena_done = 0 and ending_id = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_done = 1;
Q.e21_party = 'KPD';
Q.e21_jena_case = (Q.levi_in_party == 1) ? 2 : 1;
var hl = Q.history_luxemburgist || 0, ho = Q.history_offensive || 0, hu = Q.history_unionist || 0;
Q.e21_levi_score = hl + hu / 2 - ho + (Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction - Q.offensive_satisfaction) / 5;
Q.e21_left_ahead = (ho > hl && Q.offensive_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_left_strong = (Q.offensive_strength >= 40 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_can_readmit = (Q.e21_jena_case == 1 && Q.luxemburgist_gone != 1 && (Q.e21_levi_plea == 1 || Q.independence >= 60)) ? 1 : 0;
// a motion of Levi's friends is on the table if Levi is in the party, or his readmission can be moved
Q.e21_jena_levi_motion = (Q.luxemburgist_gone != 1 && (Q.e21_jena_case == 2 || Q.e21_can_readmit == 1)) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_unionist_here = (Q.unionist_gone != 1) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e21_jena_motions = (Q.e21_unionist_here ? 1 : 0) + (Q.offensive_gone != 1 ? 1 : 0) + Q.e21_jena_levi_motion;
!}

= The Jena Congress

From 22 to 26 August the party meets in the Volkshaus at Jena. The delegates vote to drop the word "United" from the name: from now on it is the Communist Party of Germany, the **KPD**. Nobody pretends that the name is the real business.

[? if e21_jena_case = 1 and march_action = 1 : The party has lost a great part of its members since March, to the prisons, to despair and to Levi, and those who are left want to know who is to blame. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 1 and march_action != 1 : Levi is gone. His friends are still in the hall, and the Left wants them gone too. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 and march_action = 0 : Levi is in the hall and the party is whole, but Ruth Fischer's Berlin delegates have come to settle accounts with the leaders who would not fight in March. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 and march_action != 0 : Levi is still a member, and the question of what to do with him divides the congress. ?]

[? if e21_unionist_here = 1 : Brandler, Thalheimer and Ernst Meyer ask for a Zentrale that will apply the world congress's theses. ?][? if offensive_gone = 0 : Ruth Fischer and Arkadi Maslow ask for one that will not apologise for March. ?][? if e21_jena_levi_motion = 1 and e21_jena_case = 2 : Levi's friends ask for his line, and for him. ?][? if e21_jena_levi_motion = 1 and e21_jena_case = 1 : Levi's friends move that he and those who left with him be readmitted. ?] [? if comrade_brandler = 2 : Brandler is in a fortress cell, and Thalheimer moves his motion for him. ?]

The Zentrale must decide whose motion it will fight for.

- @right: Stand with the Right's motion.
- @left: Stand with the Left's motion.
- @levi: Stand with Levi's friends.
- @alone: Put the Zentrale's own motion.

@right
view-if: e21_unionist_here = 1
subtitle: What happened, and what Moscow wants after the world congress. The Left will fight it district by district.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

The Zentrale's speakers are told: Brandler's motion and the world congress's theses, without amendments.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@left
view-if: offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The defenders of the offensive ask for the party. Lenin will not be pleased.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 2;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The Zentrale comes out for Ruth Fischer's motion. The Berlin delegates cannot believe their luck.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@levi
view-if: e21_jena_levi_motion = 1
subtitle: [? if e21_jena_case = 1 : Lenin left the door ajar, and the congress may close it. ?][? if e21_jena_case = 2 : Levi and Zetkin lead, if the congress lets them. The Left may not stay. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_jena_backing = 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

The Zentrale stands with Levi's friends, and Zetkin will move the motion. In the corridors, the Left starts counting who will walk out if it passes.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@alone
view-if: e21_jena_motions = 0
subtitle: There is no one else left to fight with.
on-arrival: e21_jena_backing = 0

The Zentrale puts its own motion to the congress.

- @open: The delegates take their seats.

@open
on-arrival: {!
var pos = [];
if (Q.e21_unionist_here) { pos.push('unionist'); }
if (Q.offensive_gone != 1) { pos.push('offensive'); }
if (Q.e21_jena_levi_motion == 1) { pos.push('luxemburgist'); }
var back = {1: 'luxemburgist', 2: 'offensive', 3: 'unionist'}[Q.e21_jena_backing] || pos[0];
RG.congressStart({
    id: 'jena',
    name: 'The Jena Congress',
    stake: 'Who leads the party after the March Action, and whether the Left or Levi\'s friends stay',
    sessions: 3,
    positions: pos,
    backing: back,
    kind: 'leadership',
    mandates: 'members',
    ownClose: true
});
// the year comes to Jena with the delegates
if (Q.march_action == 1 && Q.e21_march_mode == 2 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.1); }
// the world congress's line, and the weight of Lenin's name behind it
if (Q.comintern_member == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here && Q.directive_masses >= 1) {
    RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', Math.max(0, Math.min(0.06, (Q.ecci_lenin - 30) / 500)));
}
if (Q.march_action == 1 && Q.e21_march_mode == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.04); }
if (Q.march_action == 2 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.08); }
if (Q.march_action == 0 && Q.offensive_gone != 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('offensive', 0.04); }
if (Q.e21_masses_stance == 1 && Q.e21_unionist_here) { RG.congress.swayTo('unionist', 0.03); }
if (Q.e21_levi_fate == 3 && Q.e21_jena_levi_motion == 1) { RG.congress.swayTo('luxemburgist', 0.05); }
RG.congress.bitter(2);
!}

The Volkshaus was built by the Carl Zeiss foundation for the workers of Jena. It has a stage, a gallery and bad acoustics. The first count in the corridors gives our side [+ congress_votes_for +] per cent of the delegates.
